000100*****************************************************************
000200*  システム名  : 販売管理システム
000300*  プログラムID: USB900
000400*  プログラム名: 消費税再計算（税率改定対応）
000500*  作成日      : 1997.03.25
000600*  作成者      : 鈴木
000700*-----------------------------------------------------------------
000800*  変更履歴
000900*  1997.03 新規     鈴木  ５％移行時の売上再計算
001000*****************************************************************
001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.    USB900.
001300 AUTHOR.        SUZUKI.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.  1997-03-25.
001500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001700 SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
001800 OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
001900 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002000 FILE-CONTROL.
002100     SELECT URIN    ASSIGN TO URIAGE
002200                    ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
002300     SELECT UROUT   ASSIGN TO URINEW
002400                    ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
002500 DATA DIVISION.
002600 FILE SECTION.
002700 FD  URIN.
002800     COPY URIREC.
002900 FD  UROUT.
003000 01  UROUT-REC               PIC X(64).
003100 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003200 01  X1                      PIC 9(07)  VALUE ZERO.
003300 01  X2                      PIC 9(07)  VALUE ZERO.
003400 01  WK-ZEI                  PIC S9(09)V9(02) COMP-3.
003500 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003600 A000.
003700     OPEN INPUT URIN OUTPUT UROUT.
003800 A100.
003900     READ URIN AT END GO TO A900.
004000     ADD 1 TO X1.
004100     IF UR-DATE < 19970401
004200        GO TO A800.
004300     IF UR-ZEI-RITU NOT = 3
004400        GO TO A800.
004500     MOVE 5 TO UR-ZEI-RITU.
004600     COMPUTE WK-ZEI = URIAGE-KIN * 5 / 100.
004700     MOVE WK-ZEI TO UR-ZEI-KIN.
004800     ADD 1 TO X2.
004900 A800.
005000     WRITE UROUT-REC FROM UR-REC.
005100     GO TO A100.
005200 A900.
005300     CLOSE URIN UROUT.
005400     DISPLAY 'USB900 IN=' X1 ' UPD=' X2.
005500     STOP RUN.
